// Dialog :
"P3059397304" "The Deputy Assistant of Information hands you a beautiful synthetically grown rose. Once you have dealt swift justice to Paul Valus, the murderer of Officer Cartwright, you are to publicly commemorate the memory of the officer by placing the rose at the base of Emperor Cole's statue."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P572767782" "You brought swift justice to Paul Valus. Now all that remains is honoring the memory of Officer Cartwright and his surviving family by placing the rose at the foot of Emperor Cole's statue."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P641937960" "Visit Emperor Cole's Statue"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4180750421" "Remember, place the rose at the foot of Cole's statue, solemnly. Like you care."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1996606482" "You placed the rose at the foot of Cole's Statue. Return to the Deputy Assistant of Information."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3289274117" "Magnificent. Truly splendid. That was the best press I've ever gotten for one of you Powers Division {Hero.gender=male guys|girls}.<br><br>TPN managed to get it on camera, and they just had an interview with Cartwright's family. His wife, she was in tears. I was very heartwarming. She blessed you for your compassion and sent her love to you as well. Precious, really.<br><br>We are going places, my friend. You and me... rising to the top... heh heh... hmmm... Just as soon as I can find our next piece of work. Just, wait there one minute. I need to make a call."
// RandomFameString :
"P3728263034" "{HeroName}, you did a good thing bringing justice to Cartwright's killer."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - OfficerWelksClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P199800841" "Officer Welks"
// DetailString :
"P344265428" "According to Specialist Harrison, a PPD Warrant Officer by the name of Welks was the first person to run into the haywire Clockwork. He wants you to talk to Welks and find out what you can in order to shed some light on this mystery."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ClockworkTamperingsClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3948047383" "Clockwork Tamperings"
// DetailString :
"P1903417948" "According to Welks, she noticed some sort of tampering with the haywire Clockwork she ran into, namely signs of forced entry into a few of their secured access panels."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CMFClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P541695597" "City Maintenance Facility"
// DetailString :
"P2082595183" "Harrison did some detective work with the help of Welks's report and discovered they had foreign chips installed at the City Maintenance Facility."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ResistanceClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1759356978" "The Resistance"
// DetailString :
"P1729043299" "The man you confronted in the CMF was a member of the Resistance. It looks like the Resistance is experimenting with reprogramming the Clockwork."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2306801592" "{HeroName}. Very good news, very good. I just got off the phone with a contact of mine. One of many, I might add.<br><br>Ahem. His name is Harrison, he's a specialist working with M.I.C.I.R., the PPD crime lab. He's a good source of information, but I digress.<br><br>I need you to talk to Mr... or should I say... <i>Specialist</i> Harrison. It would appear that he has need of your wonderful talents in dealing with <color orange>a fiasco involving the Clockwork</color>.<br><br>It sounds terribly dangerous."
// AcceptString :
"P1856472654" "Help Specialist Harrison"
// SendOffString :
"P1105252197" "Oh, wonderful. <color orange>Harrison is waiting for you down by the Ministry of Information in the Magisterium</color>. Harrison is a sharp fellow; He let me in on where Paul Valus was hiding out, after all, so I figured we could return the favor, don't you think?"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2323105657" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Cut out the Middleman</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3049276306" "Speak with Specialist Harrison"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1563684116" "Specialist Harrison has the details on this clockwork fiasco he's talking about. Throw him a bone. He threw us one."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1749139076" "Thanks for talking to me, {HeroName}. I know you Powers Division {Hero.gender=male guys|gals} have a lot to do, what with the recent terrorist attacks and all, but I think this might be related.<br><br>I heard a report over the police band about a PPD engagement with some Clockwork that had apparently gone berserk.<br><br>If my suspicions are correct, this isn't a random occurence, but I need some evidence and a first hand account from you. I want you to go lend the PPD a hand and see what you can find.<br><br>Oh, and good job taking down Valus."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4105536086" "Check out the Clockwork Disturbance"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P981011715" "Chatter on the dispatch says that the PPD have requested backup twice now. You'd better hurry over there before the fight's over."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P405547884" "The familiar sound of force gauntlets mixes with plasma blasts and screaming. That sounds like the PPD alright."

