// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2859633197" "So, you came for some answers about that scuffle with those misbehaving Clockwork, huh? Well, we were kicking their metal teeth in alright before you arrived. Not that I'm not grateful.<br><br>Something strange, you ask?<br><br>You know, now that you mention it, yeah, I did notice something. They all looked like there had been some significant damage done to their head casings. I figured it was just from a previous run in with a PPD officer, or maybe beating up on each other, but now I'm thinking it was forced entry from someone else... maybe someone's been tampering with their heads?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P810197776" "Return to Specialist Harrison"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P87700171" "Hey {HeroName}, what did you find out?<br><br>Tampering? Hey, wait a second. One of my buddies over at M.I.C.I.R. just got a hold of the haywire Clockwork, and they're studying it now. Let me give him a call.<br><br>Hey, Parson, yeah, it's Harrison. Hey, do those clockwork show any signs of forced entry?<br><br>They do? Well, {HeroName} thinks someone may have tampered with them...<br><br>What? A foreign chip? Fused to the motherboard?<br><br>Right... well, I have {HeroName} here right now, I'll tell {Hero.gender=male him|her}.<br><br>Alright, Parson says that there was a foreign chip installed on those Clockwork, and their navigational records suggest it happened back <color orange>inside the City Maintenance Facility</color>. I think you'll find our culprit there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P251480713" "Check out the CMF"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2896960451" "The navigational data in this clockwork indicates that it powered up with the new memory chip back at the City Maintenance Facility. Check it out."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4151494479" "Everything seemed perfectly fine until you ran into a Clockwork slamming its head against the wall. You deactivated it and moved into the facility for a closer look."
// ExitStringSuccess :
"P861671180" "You are startled, briefly, when you emerge from the CMF maintence door to find a TPN camera crew and reporter there ready to interview you. You answer a few questions until the PPD arrive and order the TPN crew off the premesis. Handing over the traitor, you find yourself free to return to the Deputy."

