// Dialog :
"P448214009" "You put an end to the haywire clockwork problem. Return to the Deputy Assistant of Information."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P212497537" "Grand job in thwarting that evil Resistance plot, {HeroName}. I made sure to inform one of my contacts over at TPN of your latest exploits, so I hope they managed to catch up to you.<br><br>I uh, hope you didn't mind having to do a little leg work. It seems that Harrison wasn't very forthcoming with the information this time around. But don't you worry, next time, I'll be on top of things..."
// RandomFameString :
"P1262178287" "I watched another TPN special report about how {HeroName} stopped a terrorist plot to blow up the City Maintenance Facility."

